      "asset": "home-instrument",
      "group": "homepage",
      "title": "Instrument",
      "context": "Work collection section",
      "observed": "A large statement sits over an asymmetric project pairing. The smaller project includes a client name, explanation and discipline label; Stack and Grid controls are visible.",
      "adapt": "Give a project a prominent visual and preserve a useful caption. Deliberate scale can communicate priority once a lead project is chosen.",
      "caution": "This is a collection reference, not proof of homepage behavior. Filters and layout switches would add little to three projects.",
